    <string name="account_safety_point_1">Lumen is unofficial and is not affiliated with Google. It uploads to Google Photos in a way Google did not design for third-party apps.</string>
    <string name="account_safety_point_2">This may violate Google\'s Terms of Service. Google can sign you out, restrict, or disable an account at any time, and this has happened to users of similar tools.</string>
    <string name="account_safety_point_3">A disabled Google account can also lock you out of Gmail, Drive, and everything else tied to it.</string>
    <string name="account_safety_point_4">Use an account you can afford to lose access to. Avoid your main email, or accounts used for work, school or banking.</string>
    <string name="account_safety_point_5">Do not treat Google Photos as your only copy. Keep your original photos until you have confirmed they are safe.</string>
    <string name="account_safety_point_6">If Google signs you out or asks you to verify your account, stop and do not keep retrying. Lumen will pause uploads for you.</string>
    <string name="account_safety_point_7">Each sign-in registers a device on your Google account. Avoid signing in and out repeatedly.</string>

